.github
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/node_modules
**/.next
apps/web/out
apps/web/coverage
data/raw
data/processed
data/models
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
docs
*.md
!apps/api/README.md
